text = "WASD to move, (J or LMB), (K or RMB) and (L or Space) for attacks.
If you hold SHIFT you can maintain your facing direction.

Dont let the bad guys kill the castle

Inside the castle the Monk will heal you and you can  purchase some upgrades from the blacksmith.

There are 6 enemy towers. Destroy them all with TNT to become a true legend of the Kingdom."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

