text = "In the main castle you can purchase TNT.

Once you have a TNT take it to an enemy tower to destroy it

Once an enemy tower is destroyed a nearby ruined unit hut will be available for rebuilding.

Each Unit Hut has 3 unit slots.  Purchase a unit to fill each slot. Once all slots are filled you can start upgrading the units.


Clicking the flag button allows you to move your troops!"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

