theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 40
text = "Each playable character uses a flow bar for their main attacks

When you first press the attack button your character will get into a ready stance and start filling a yellow bar.

Once the yellow bar reaches the green section press the attack button again to execute a                    attack!
The L attack is a double flow check.
As food depletes the green section gets smaller, purchase food in the castle.

Critical attacks are important for DPS, finishing the attack early and dealing extra damage."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

